When the dad says to the son, you're no longer a boy. You're a man, and I see you differently than I did before. Some guys are acting out some of the boyishness way into their 30s and 40s because their dad never put that line of demarcation in there where he said you're not that anymore.

00:40:54.353 --> 00:41:13.656
