That's not something that we see in our world. I mean, there's very little of that. In the Jewish culture, they have the bar mitzvah. I mean, literally to say it at 13, to a Jewish boy, you were a boy, you're not a boy anymore.

00:41:51.082 --> 00:42:17.871
