That won't make you better. It'll actually make you worse. So the third wound is the disconnected from other men and mentors wound. Here's the definition. Social, emotional, and spiritual blind spots and/or deficits caused by a lack of healthy male comradeship that results over time in foolish actions, serious setbacks, and short-sighted masculinity.

