Definition, we are fallen and cursed creatures at odds with our creator. In other words, Adam sinned and we follow in his footsteps. All have sinned and fall short of the glory of God. And what you guys have heard me say multiple times is that the basic struggle of sin is the selfish pride that we want to make everything about us and all of the bad tentacles that come off in other kinds of behavior about that.

00:51:37.290 --> 00:51:52.261
